# Suono

This repository contains an Android app prototype for a music streaming experience.

## What it includes

- Material 3 interface
- list of curated tracks
- playback using ExoPlayer
- simple player controls
- ready-to-replace demo catalog

## Important note

This project is intentionally built as a legal starter app using royalty-free demo audio URLs. It is designed to be adapted to a licensed music provider or a backend with authorized rights.

For a production app that streams real, licensed artist catalog content, you must integrate an authorized provider or a custom backend with clear licensing and API access.

## Getting started

1. Open the project in Android Studio.
2. Let Gradle sync.
3. Run the `app` module on an emulator or physical device.

## Main package

- `app/src/main/java/com/cerberossss4/ctrl/suono` contains the Android app code
- `app/src/main/java/com/cerberossss4/ctrl/suono/data` contains the demo catalog model

## Next steps for a real music catalog

- replace `DemoCatalog` with a real API response
- connect to a licensed provider
- add authentication, search, favorites, and playlists
- add cover art and metadata from your backend
